       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.           SFRTINQ.
       AUTHOR.               KALMAN.
       DATE-WRITTEN.         JUNE 1993.
      *INSTALLATION.         GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.

      *D* REMARKS.
      *D*
      *D* THIS IS AN ONLINE SUBRTN THAT WILL ALLOW THE USER
      *D* TO SEE ALL RELEVANT FIELDS ON A SINGLE FREIGHT BILL.
      *D*
      *D* TO USE IT, THE RELATIVE RECORD NUMBER OF THE RECORD TO
      *D* INQUIRE ON MUST BE PASSED. FOR AN EXAMPLE OF HOW TO GET
      *D* THE RELATIVE RECORD NUMBER SEE TFRTWRKMNL.
      *D*
      *D* THE FIELD RTN-CODE (PIC 9) WILL CONTAIN A VALUE THAT SHOULD
      *D* BE CHECKED FROM THE CALLING PGM.
      *D*
      *D* IF THE VALUE IS...   IT MEANS...
      *D*       0                 SFRTINQ WAS SUCCESSFUL
      *D*       2                 THE RECORD WAS NOT FOUND IN DAPPLFRT
      *D*       8                 BAD SCREEN I-O ACTIVITY
      *D*       9                 BAD FILE I-O ACTIVITY
      *D*
      *D* IF RTN-CODE DOES NOT EQUAL 0, THE BLOWUP FIELDS WILL BE FILLED
      *D* WITH RELEVANT DATA. TBLOWUP SHOULD BE CALLED.
      *D*
      *C* CHANGES.
      *C*
      *C*   01/08/2004    CA YODER
      *C*     INCREASED RELATIVE RECORD SIZE FIELD FROM 4 TO 5.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.

      ******************************************************************
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZFREIGHT-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.
           SELECT DAPPLFRT-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFPCA1100
                  ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RELATIVE KEY IS DAPPLFRT-IX
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

      ******************************************************************
       DATA DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************

       FILE SECTION.

       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC         PIC X(1000).

       FD  DAPPLFRT-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DAPPLFRT-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCA1100  OF MCFPCA1100.
      ******************************************************************
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  M I S C E L L A N E O U S   D A T E   &   T I M E   F I E L D S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       01  CUR-DATE.
           05  CUR-DATE-CC                PIC X(2).
           05  CUR-SYSTEM-DATE.
               10  CUR-DATE-YY            PIC X(2).
               10  CUR-DATE-MM            PIC X(2).
               10  CUR-DATE-DD            PIC X(2).

       01  CUR-TIME                       PIC X(4).

       01  CONV-DATE                      PIC X(10).

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  A R G U M E N T   V A L U E S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       01  PO-14-ARG                          VALUE SPACES.
           05  PO-11-ARG.
               10  PO-PREFIX-ARG    PIC X.
               10  PO-10-ARG.
                   15  PO-NUM-ARG   PIC X(7).
                   15  PO-RLS-ARG   PIC X(3).
           05  PO-RCVR-ARG          PIC X(3).
       01  PO-14-ARG-DUP            REDEFINES PO-14-ARG.
           05  PO-PREFIX-ARG-DUP    PIC X.
           05  PO-13-ARG            PIC X(13).

       01  RAIL-CAR-ARG             PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.

       01  DATE-ARG.
           05  DATE-CC         PIC X(2).
           05  DATE-YY         PIC X(2).
           05  DATE-MM         PIC X(2).
           05  DATE-DD         PIC X(2).

       01  RECNUM-ARG          PIC 9(4) COMP-4.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  F L A G S   A N D   S W I T C H E S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       01  DAPPLFRT-EOF             PIC X.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  I N D E X E S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  A C C U M U L A T O R S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  S A V E   F I E L D S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  T A B L E S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  B U F F E R S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       01  BUF-SCREEN1.
           05  S1-PO-RCVR         PIC X(15).
           05  S1-PAIDDT          PIC X(10).
           05  S1-SHIPDT          PIC X(10).
           05  S1-CAR             PIC X(10).
           05  S1-TERMS           PIC X(2).
           05  S1-PCARR           PIC X(4).
           05  S1-RCARR           PIC X(4).
           05  S1-PPRONUM         PIC X(16).
           05  S1-RPRONUM         PIC X(16).
           05  S1-PCHARGES        PIC S9(10)V99.
           05  S1-RCHARGES        PIC S9(10)V99.
           05  S1-PTAXES          PIC S9(10)V99.
           05  S1-PCHGAPPDT       PIC X(10).
           05  S1-RCHGAPPDT       PIC X(10).
           05  S1-PRCVDDT         PIC X(10).
           05  S1-RRCVDDT         PIC X(10).
           05  S1-STATUS          PIC X(10).
           05  S1-STATDT          PIC X(10).

       COPY DAPPLFRT IN COPYLIB.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  D A T A B A S E   S T A T U S   A R E A
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1             PIC X.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2             PIC X.

       COPY DBCSACCT OF COPYLIB.

       COPY DATAB    OF COPYLIB.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  U T I L I T Y   A R E A
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       01  WS-CONTROL.
           05  FUNCTION-KEY       PIC XX.
               88  ENTER-KEY-USED                       VALUE "00".
               88  F1-KEY-USED                          VALUE "01".
               88  F2-KEY-USED                          VALUE "02".
               88  F3-KEY-USED                          VALUE "03".
               88  F4-KEY-USED                          VALUE "04".
               88  F5-KEY-USED                          VALUE "05".
               88  F6-KEY-USED                          VALUE "06".
               88  F7-KEY-USED                          VALUE "07".
               88  F8-KEY-USED                          VALUE "08".
               88  F9-KEY-USED                          VALUE "09".
               88  F10-KEY-USED                         VALUE "10".
               88  F11-KEY-USED                         VALUE "11".
               88  F12-KEY-USED                         VALUE "12".
           05  TERMINAL-ID        PIC X(10).
           05  FORMAT-NAME        PIC X(10).

       01  DISPLAY-STATUS         PIC X(2).

       01  SRF-INDICATORS.
           05  IND                PIC 1
                                  OCCURS 99 TIMES
                                  INDICATOR 1.
               88  IND-OFF        VALUE B"0".
               88  IND-ON         VALUE B"1".

       01  OFF-SWITCH             PIC 1  VALUE B"0".
       01  ON-SWITCH              PIC 1  VALUE B"1".

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  L I N K A G E   S E C T I O N
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       LINKAGE SECTION.

       01  DAPPLFRT-IX            PIC 9(5) COMP-4.

       01  RTN-CODE               PIC 9.

       01  BU-DISPLAY-MSG         PIC X(60).

       01  BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
           05  BU-DISPLAY-LINE OCCURS 5 TIMES.
               10  BU-DISPLAY-FLD        PIC X(14).
               10  BU-DISPLAY-FLD9       PIC S9(8).

      ******************************************************************
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING DAPPLFRT-IX, RTN-CODE,
                                BU-DISPLAY-MSG, BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
      ******************************************************************

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       MAIN SECTION.
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       0-CONTROL.

           PERFORM 1-HSK.

           PERFORM 6-MAIN THRU 6-MAIN-X.

           PERFORM 2-EOJ.

           GOBACK.

       1-HSK.

           OPEN I-O        DISPLAY-FILE.
           OPEN INPUT      DAPPLFRT-I.

       2-EOJ.

           CLOSE           DISPLAY-FILE            DAPPLFRT-I.

       6-MAIN.

           INITIALIZE DAPPLFRT-EOF.
           INITIALIZE RTN-CODE.

      *----FIND DAPPLFRT-REC USING RELATIVE RECORD NUMBER

           PERFORM 9999-READ-DAPPLFRT-I.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
              MOVE "DAPPLFRT NOT FOUND*6-MAIN" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              MOVE "IN SFRTINQ"  TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
              MOVE DAPPLFRT-IX   TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
              MOVE 2             TO RTN-CODE
              GOBACK.

      *----LOAD DAPPLFRT TO SCREEN.

           IF DAPPL-PO-13 > SPACES

              STRING DAPPL-PO-NUM   DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                     "-"            DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                     DAPPL-PO-RLS   DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                     "-"            DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                     DAPPL-PO-RCVR  DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO S1-PO-RCVR
           ELSE
              MOVE SPACES TO S1-PO-RCVR.

           MOVE DAPPL-TIS-PAID-DATE        TO DATE-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-CONV-DATE.
           MOVE CONV-DATE                  TO S1-PAIDDT.

           MOVE DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE        TO DATE-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-CONV-DATE.
           MOVE CONV-DATE                  TO S1-SHIPDT.

           MOVE DAPPL-RAIL-CAR             TO S1-CAR.
           MOVE DAPPL-TERMS                TO S1-TERMS.

           MOVE DAPPL-PAID-PRO-NO          TO S1-PPRONUM.
           MOVE DAPPL-RATED-PRO-NO         TO S1-RPRONUM.
           MOVE DAPPL-PAID-CARRIER         TO S1-PCARR.
           MOVE DAPPL-RATED-CARRIER        TO S1-RCARR.
           MOVE DAPPL-PAID-AMT             TO S1-PCHARGES.
           MOVE DAPPL-RATED-AMT            TO S1-RCHARGES.
           MOVE DAPPL-PAID-TAX             TO S1-PTAXES.

           MOVE DAPPL-PAID-APPL-DATE       TO DATE-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-CONV-DATE.
           MOVE CONV-DATE                  TO S1-PCHGAPPDT.

           MOVE DAPPL-RATED-APPL-DATE      TO DATE-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-CONV-DATE.
           MOVE CONV-DATE                  TO S1-RCHGAPPDT.

           MOVE DAPPL-PAID-RCV-DATE        TO DATE-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-CONV-DATE.
           MOVE CONV-DATE                  TO S1-PRCVDDT.

           MOVE DAPPL-RATED-RCV-DATE       TO DATE-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-CONV-DATE.
           MOVE CONV-DATE                  TO S1-RRCVDDT.

           IF DAPPL-STATUS-1 = SPACES
              MOVE "ACTIVE"                TO S1-STATUS.
           IF DAPPL-STATUS-1 = "X"
              MOVE "CANCELED"              TO S1-STATUS.

           MOVE DAPPL-STATUS-DATE          TO DATE-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-CONV-DATE.
           MOVE CONV-DATE                  TO S1-STATDT.

       60-SHOW-SCREEN1.

      *----DISPLAY SCREEN.

           WRITE DISPLAY-REC FROM BUF-SCREEN1
                 FORMAT IS "FRTINQ"
                 INDICATORS ARE SRF-INDICATORS.

           IF DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = ZERO
              MOVE "SHOW SCREEN1 FAILED*60-SS" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              MOVE "IN SFRTINQ"        TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
              MOVE DAPPL-PO-14         TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
              MOVE DAPPL-RAIL-CAR      TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
              MOVE DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (4)
              MOVE 8                   TO RTN-CODE
              GOBACK.

      *----READ USER INPUT.

           READ DISPLAY-FILE INTO BUF-SCREEN1
                FORMAT IS "FRTINQ"
                INDICATORS ARE SRF-INDICATORS.

           IF DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "READ SCREEN1 FAILED*60-SS" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              MOVE "IN SFRTINQ"        TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
              MOVE DAPPL-PO-14         TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
              MOVE DAPPL-RAIL-CAR      TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
              MOVE DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (4)
              MOVE 8                   TO RTN-CODE
              GOBACK.

      *----TAKE INDICATED ACTION.

           IF ENTER-KEY-USED
              GO TO 60-SHOW-SCREEN1.

           IF F3-KEY-USED
              GO TO 6-MAIN-X.



       6-MAIN-X.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       9999-UTILITY SECTION.
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       9999-CONV-DATE.

           IF DATE-ARG NOT = SPACES
              STRING DATE-ARG (1:4) DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                     "-"            DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                     DATE-ARG (5:2) DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                     "-"            DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                     DATE-ARG (7:2) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO CONV-DATE
           ELSE
              MOVE SPACES TO CONV-DATE.

      *---------------------------------
      * DAPPLFRT
      *---------------------------------

       9999-READ-DAPPLFRT-I.
           READ DAPPLFRT-I INTO BUF-DAPPLFRT
                INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              IF FILE-STATUS-1 NOT = "2"
                 MOVE "READ DAPPLFRT*9999-RDI" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                 MOVE "IN SFRTINQ"    TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                 MOVE DAPPLFRT-IX     TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
                 MOVE 9 TO RTN-CODE
                 GOBACK.

